WEBVTT

00:17.851 --> 00:20.187
Die, monster!

00:21.522 --> 00:23.607
Heteromorphs shouldn't leave the house!

00:23.690 --> 00:25.651
I can't believe you have impure blood...

00:27.778 --> 00:29.613
You all tricked us.

00:29.696 --> 00:31.240
The land will be defiled.

00:31.323 --> 00:32.741
Go away!

00:35.869 --> 00:42.167
No matter how much time passes,
we will never accept your kind.

02:22.768 --> 02:24.936
Going back in time a little,

02:25.062 --> 02:28.398
after news that Dabi had been captured
spread across the battlefield...

02:28.523 --> 02:30.400
IN FRONT OF CENTRAL HOSPITAL

02:31.777 --> 02:34.905
Get the captured Kurogiri back!

02:36.448 --> 02:41.870
The bioengineered High End Nomu
closest to being a masterpiece...

02:42.204 --> 02:43.163
Kurogiri.

02:44.081 --> 02:47.834
After All For One determined that
Kurogiri was at this hospital,

02:49.211 --> 02:53.423
he sent Spinner, one of the Paranormal
Liberation Front leaders,

02:53.507 --> 02:58.178
with the Remnants and ordinary citizens
who agreed with their ideology--

02:58.595 --> 03:02.933
15,000 people strong in all.

03:08.105 --> 03:09.439
Go!

03:09.523 --> 03:10.941
Let us through!

03:11.024 --> 03:12.192
Move!

03:12.484 --> 03:13.860
Surround them!

03:13.944 --> 03:15.320
Don't get pushed back!

03:15.612 --> 03:17.823
Clear a path!

03:18.281 --> 03:19.741
Intercepting them

03:20.242 --> 03:21.743
were the remaining heroes

03:22.119 --> 03:23.829
and the remaining members
of the police squad.

03:24.579 --> 03:27.290
They numbered about 200.

03:28.041 --> 03:32.170
You've gotten pretty
popular, huh, Shirakumo?

03:34.506 --> 03:36.508
Loudout Shout!

03:39.803 --> 03:41.596
A wall of flesh?

03:49.896 --> 03:51.940
Mr. Present Mic, are you okay?

03:52.065 --> 03:53.608
Thanks, Anima!

03:53.692 --> 03:54.734
Where's Tentacole?

03:55.026 --> 03:57.279
We got split up as we were fighting...

03:57.362 --> 03:59.114
I've been looking for him,

03:59.197 --> 04:00.991
but there are too many people.

04:06.246 --> 04:09.249
Squad Leader, there are too
many of them! We need backup!

04:09.583 --> 04:11.543
We don't have any!

04:11.626 --> 04:13.795
Push them back with the taser shields!

04:14.296 --> 04:17.257
Damn it! We're already outnumbered,

04:17.591 --> 04:20.302
but now they're moving to split us up, too!

04:22.929 --> 04:24.639
Aren't they supposed to be
a thrown-together mob?

04:24.890 --> 04:27.434
How are they so organized?

04:27.517 --> 04:29.478
Be quiet! Shut up! Tie 'em up!

04:29.561 --> 04:31.021
- That's enough!
- We're not a mob!

04:31.104 --> 04:32.022
The hands! The hands!

04:32.105 --> 04:34.107
You people are always like this!

04:34.399 --> 04:37.903
No one who looks human can understand!

04:43.033 --> 04:44.201
Move!

04:44.284 --> 04:45.452
Crush them!

04:45.535 --> 04:46.620
Clear a path!

04:47.496 --> 04:50.123
- Let him through! Move!
Out of the way! Move it!

04:52.542 --> 04:54.336
- Move! Out of the way! Let him through!
- Let him through!

04:55.295 --> 04:56.296
Stop-

04:57.464 --> 05:01.218
Wh-Why are you doing this? Please stop!

05:01.718 --> 05:03.470
You a city kid?

05:03.553 --> 05:06.431
You're a traitor!

05:14.481 --> 05:16.483
Get angry, citizens!

05:16.566 --> 05:18.777
Today is the day of liberation!

05:18.860 --> 05:22.656
Quirk counseling! Quirk education!

05:23.156 --> 05:28.703
We know that it's all a
sham because of our forms!

05:29.120 --> 05:30.789
The 6/6 Incident.

05:30.872 --> 05:33.083
The Great Jeda Purge!

05:33.667 --> 05:38.755
"Paranormal" means a history of
persecution of the differently-formed.

05:43.218 --> 05:47.681
One of the men who participated in one
massacre gave his reason as simply,

05:47.764 --> 05:49.891
"They creep me out."

05:50.642 --> 05:54.354
In the present day, the world feels
remorse for those actions...

05:54.563 --> 05:58.400
No! They're just pretending
to be remorseful!

05:58.775 --> 06:03.780
Those raised in densely populated
areas in a diverse melting pot...

06:03.864 --> 06:06.741
Oh, how wonderfully educated they are!

06:06.825 --> 06:09.661
They would never discriminate, right?

06:09.744 --> 06:13.373
But try leaving the city, and you'll see--

06:14.332 --> 06:16.793
"They creep me out."

06:16.876 --> 06:21.423
Even the strongest light can't illuminate
everything when that phrase is uttered.

06:21.506 --> 06:25.218
Gathered here today are all those
who couldn't be illuminated!

06:25.552 --> 06:28.888
We will illuminate ourselves!

06:28.972 --> 06:33.518
Have you ever thought, "If only
I didn't look like this"?

06:34.352 --> 06:37.814
SPINNER IS OUR SPOKESPERSON
- YOU PEOPLE ARE NOT OUR HEROES!

06:39.900 --> 06:44.571
He is the one who will lead
us to the center of society!

06:44.654 --> 06:45.572
We're gonna win!

06:45.655 --> 06:47.073
We just have to win this!

06:47.157 --> 06:49.910
Make way for the spokesperson!

06:53.038 --> 06:54.497
Liberate yourselves.

06:54.914 --> 06:58.001
Clean up the vestiges of the old regime

06:58.084 --> 07:01.671
and realize Re-Destro's revolution.

07:02.047 --> 07:04.591
It doesn't matter if the League of Villains

07:04.674 --> 07:07.719
will bear the responsibilities
of true liberators or not.

07:07.802 --> 07:09.554
Worship them!

07:09.638 --> 07:12.557
We will make them into the real thing!

07:12.641 --> 07:13.850
Follow the spokesperson!

07:13.933 --> 07:16.353
Yeah, we're on the side of justice!

07:18.396 --> 07:21.566
I don't know what he's saying...

07:23.109 --> 07:28.323
Ever since I got power from All For One...

07:29.616 --> 07:33.912
My mind... keeps going blank...

07:33.995 --> 07:36.164
Hey, Spokesperson!

07:36.748 --> 07:38.583
Oh well...

07:39.250 --> 07:43.630
I'll just do what I was told.

07:43.713 --> 07:47.550
Get Kurogiri back!

07:49.302 --> 07:51.304
Octoblow!

07:55.058 --> 07:56.351
Our spokesperson!

07:56.434 --> 07:59.312
You bastard!

07:59.396 --> 08:01.731
He's a traitor! Kill him!

08:01.815 --> 08:04.150
A wannabe hero! Kill him!

08:07.195 --> 08:09.614
Die, monster!

08:09.698 --> 08:11.991
Heteromorphs shouldn't leave the house!

08:12.784 --> 08:15.078
I can't believe you have impure blood...

08:17.747 --> 08:19.290
The land will be defiled.

08:19.374 --> 08:20.667
Go away!

08:21.584 --> 08:27.924
What does that have to do with you
attacking the hospital right now?

08:30.009 --> 08:34.681
When the heroes were
investigating Jaku Hospital,

08:35.640 --> 08:37.225
the first thing they did

08:37.642 --> 08:42.689
was make sure the patients
and staff were safe.

08:43.648 --> 08:47.569
Make sure those in the
hospital... were safe?

08:47.652 --> 08:51.781
Well? What about you?

08:53.283 --> 08:59.706
No matter how much time passes,
we will never accept your kind.

09:02.500 --> 09:04.335
Do you people...

09:06.087 --> 09:08.256
Do you have a plan?!

09:12.385 --> 09:14.137
Say that you do!

09:15.847 --> 09:17.849
If you don't, I won't forgive you!

09:17.932 --> 09:19.893
TOGETHER WITH SHOJI
- IF YOU DON'T, I WON'T FORGIVE YOU!

09:19.976 --> 09:21.936
TOGETHER WITH SHOJI

09:23.563 --> 09:25.940
MEZO SHOJI

09:29.569 --> 09:31.946
KOJI KODA

09:32.864 --> 09:34.699
Do you have a plan?!

09:35.116 --> 09:36.451
Say that you do!

09:36.910 --> 09:40.914
If you don't, I won't forgive you!

09:42.457 --> 09:43.958
I hear Shoji's voice.

09:45.168 --> 09:47.170
Ouch!

09:47.587 --> 09:51.007
Do I have a plan?

09:51.508 --> 09:55.345
What the hell is with this guy?

09:56.221 --> 09:57.889
What's with that kid?

09:57.972 --> 09:59.349
Look at those scars...

09:59.432 --> 10:01.392
No, but...

10:01.643 --> 10:04.354
Spokesperson, you said it, didn't you?

10:04.437 --> 10:06.940
That we'd destroy everything
that persecuted us!

10:07.065 --> 10:09.150
We'll follow Spinner!

10:09.234 --> 10:11.903
Take back Kurogiri, even
if mean means sacrifices!

10:11.986 --> 10:14.864
Just tell us! You're justice!

10:15.281 --> 10:19.202
What kind of light will you show us?

10:19.285 --> 10:21.454
We want to know!

10:21.538 --> 10:23.915
Tell us!

10:26.751 --> 10:28.878
Who cares...

10:29.420 --> 10:31.840
"Who cares"?

10:32.632 --> 10:33.633
He's saying--

10:34.425 --> 10:37.804
"Bloodshed is how history is made."

10:37.887 --> 10:43.017
In other words, he's saying that
sacrifices are unavoidable!

10:45.144 --> 10:48.356
That kid... and Spinner!

10:48.731 --> 10:50.608
Why'd they have to say that?

10:51.442 --> 10:53.319
Forward!

10:54.195 --> 10:56.197
Go forward!

11:01.369 --> 11:02.787
Spinner...

11:03.580 --> 11:07.292
this will make society regress 30 years.

11:08.334 --> 11:09.794
Shut...

11:09.878 --> 11:11.880
up...!

11:13.798 --> 11:16.593
Seriously...!

11:18.261 --> 11:19.512
Iguchi...

11:20.638 --> 11:24.809
If you still have trouble with
that Body Bulk I gave you,

11:25.268 --> 11:27.437
then use this...

11:28.980 --> 11:33.735
Seriously, I...

11:34.360 --> 11:36.529
Scalemail.

11:36.905 --> 11:42.452
With this, you'll have the power,
defense, and looks to be a leader.

11:42.535 --> 11:45.830
That's also...

11:46.915 --> 11:47.916
LooL?

11:48.291 --> 11:50.752
I played it, too. I was
a solo player, though.

11:51.753 --> 11:54.797
Enough already!

11:58.551 --> 12:02.472
That's enough! Keep going!

12:14.901 --> 12:16.110
Shoji!

12:16.194 --> 12:17.487
Comrades!

12:17.820 --> 12:22.700
Our spokesperson's path gives the
oppressed the courage to strike back.

12:22.784 --> 12:24.911
Martyr yourselves for the revolution!

12:24.994 --> 12:29.999
The blood shed today will bring
rights to future heteromorphs!

12:32.585 --> 12:34.337
You've got to be kidding...

12:34.754 --> 12:36.381
Shoji is...

12:38.591 --> 12:40.260
Shoji is...!

12:42.679 --> 12:45.598
My parents didn't have arms like this.

12:47.266 --> 12:48.851
The people in the village were terrible.

12:49.769 --> 12:53.648
When I tried to touch someone, they
all gathered for a blood purification

12:53.731 --> 12:55.775
and ganged up on me to beat me up.

12:57.235 --> 12:59.654
Tokoyami, Koda, and the rest
of you who grew up in cities

12:59.737 --> 13:02.073
might only know about this from textbooks,

13:03.324 --> 13:07.537
but there are still places that will
leave scars like this on children.

13:08.037 --> 13:11.290
I won't allow it! We've got to
get rid of people like that!

13:12.583 --> 13:16.921
That's good, but there's still disparity.

13:19.132 --> 13:22.176
I feel like I called you "octopus" before...

13:22.885 --> 13:24.137
What are you, a gorilla?

13:24.220 --> 13:26.014
Oh, an octopus?

13:26.097 --> 13:28.683
Octopuses are sexy.

13:28.975 --> 13:29.934
I'm sorry!

13:30.059 --> 13:34.063
But I never thought you
were creepy or anything!

13:34.355 --> 13:37.442
It's natural to think of an
octopus when you see my arms.

13:37.525 --> 13:39.902
My hero name is Tentacole, too.

13:39.986 --> 13:45.992
Besides, I look at tabloid stuff like the
rankings of heroes who look like villains.

13:46.576 --> 13:49.370
It's not like I want you to treat
the topic as taboo because of me.

13:50.246 --> 13:54.751
But my scars and heteromorph form
give people ideas about me.

13:55.293 --> 13:57.086
That's why I wear a mask.

13:58.296 --> 14:01.257
Because I don't want people to
think I'm trying to get revenge.

14:05.261 --> 14:06.554
You're really strong.

14:07.221 --> 14:09.557
I had to get through a lot of bad times.

14:12.477 --> 14:14.270
I'll never forget them.

14:17.190 --> 14:18.191
But...

14:23.613 --> 14:25.948
instead of tallying up the bad memories,

14:40.254 --> 14:41.881
I'd rather cling

14:43.591 --> 14:48.137
to the one good memory I have of this body.

14:52.100 --> 14:55.728
Don't say there's only one! Seriously!

14:56.229 --> 14:57.605
Let's make lots more good memories!

14:57.688 --> 14:59.857
I KNOW THIS WARMTH
- LET'S MAKE LOTS MORE GOOD MEMORIES!

14:59.941 --> 15:03.277
I KNOW THIS WARMTH
- MAKE SOME GOOD MEMORIES WITH US!

15:03.945 --> 15:04.862
Yeah.

15:04.946 --> 15:07.532
Warm... so warm...

15:08.950 --> 15:11.953
These fetters that have been in
place for over a hundred years

15:12.036 --> 15:15.039
cannot be broken in one generation.

15:17.542 --> 15:24.048
That's why, like those who have come
before me, I also want to pass it on.

15:25.258 --> 15:27.927
I'll become the coolest hero on earth

15:31.681 --> 15:34.475
and give the next generation good memories.

15:35.476 --> 15:37.645
I was persecuted, too!

15:37.728 --> 15:41.190
The people who hurt us were not
justified in their actions!

15:41.274 --> 15:44.318
But this isn't the way to do it!

15:45.486 --> 15:51.075
A number of shelters turned me away, saying
they couldn't let heteromorphs in.

15:51.159 --> 15:52.910
Who cares!

15:52.994 --> 15:56.038
Destroy it all!

15:56.122 --> 15:58.249
Think about how you're using your anger!

15:58.332 --> 16:00.209
You should be able to think about it!

16:00.293 --> 16:04.547
Because we've been hurt!

16:06.340 --> 16:10.261
If we could just forgive and forget,
it wouldn't have ended up like this!

16:10.344 --> 16:11.846
There's nothing concrete!

16:11.929 --> 16:14.849
You're just shouting your selfish feelings!

16:15.183 --> 16:17.393
Our hearts that could've been
moved by such childish thoughts

16:17.476 --> 16:20.479
were crushed by society a long time ago!

16:22.857 --> 16:24.108
Don't laugh...

16:27.653 --> 16:31.574
Don't laugh at Shoji!

16:37.705 --> 16:38.789
Anima.

16:48.299 --> 16:49.717
Gross.

16:50.635 --> 16:54.347
Yeah, this is who I am!

16:55.723 --> 16:57.141
Tentacole.

16:59.352 --> 17:04.023
Please assign us to protect
Central Hospital.

17:04.899 --> 17:07.235
Why do you know about that?

17:07.318 --> 17:09.028
We didn't tell you anything yet.

17:10.071 --> 17:13.532
That tall woman said something concerning,

17:13.616 --> 17:15.785
so I asked her what it was
like on the outside.

17:16.661 --> 17:18.246
That tall girl?

17:18.329 --> 17:21.040
In addition, there are
those among the evacuees

17:22.375 --> 17:23.417
who mentioned a call to action.

17:24.293 --> 17:26.545
I heard that heteromorphs
from all over the country

17:26.629 --> 17:29.382
were heading toward Central Hospital.

17:30.591 --> 17:32.301
Please let me go.

17:32.718 --> 17:35.471
If Shoji's going, I want to go, too.

17:37.682 --> 17:39.350
If I overlook this,

17:40.434 --> 17:44.105
I will never be able to call myself a hero.

17:52.488 --> 17:57.493
We put out a fake transport address,
but the enemy didn't take the bait.

17:59.203 --> 18:03.457
Yamada, sorry but can you go support them?

18:05.042 --> 18:10.131
Mr. Aizawa, Quirks get stronger
with each generation.

18:11.882 --> 18:13.426
These guys are already

18:14.135 --> 18:21.100
way stronger than we were back when
we were called the Three Dumbingos.

18:24.228 --> 18:25.688
Koji.

18:26.480 --> 18:29.900
You might get horns someday, too.

18:30.818 --> 18:36.866
These horns will let you tell
faraway animals how you feel.

18:38.409 --> 18:43.039
Because of how I look, some
people were mean to me,

18:43.122 --> 18:46.876
but your dad got mad at
those people for me.

18:47.293 --> 18:50.254
He said, "Don't laugh at
her beautiful horns!"

18:51.422 --> 18:54.800
Koji, make sure you get mad

18:55.217 --> 18:57.803
when people laugh at someone
important to you.

18:58.179 --> 19:00.848
Make sure you grow up to be someone
who can get mad properly.

19:01.932 --> 19:05.436
Hitchcock Birds!

19:24.538 --> 19:28.000
Octospansion!

19:37.385 --> 19:42.181
What will you protect with your
giant body and scales, Spinner?

19:43.516 --> 19:45.142
And the rest of you, too!

19:45.226 --> 19:47.478
With the bodies you were blessed with,

19:47.561 --> 19:49.438
what do you want to protect?

19:52.483 --> 19:54.860
Don't let them take advantage of your scars!

19:55.444 --> 19:59.448
Next time, your children
might be the target!

20:05.371 --> 20:10.334
If I hadn't been drowning back then...

20:11.460 --> 20:17.007
maybe your face wouldn't
have gotten so scary...

20:20.678 --> 20:23.889
Don't turn into people
who just want revenge!

20:30.020 --> 20:32.356
M-My hatred...

20:32.440 --> 20:35.025
w-won't go away!

20:35.526 --> 20:36.819
Spokesperson!

20:37.486 --> 20:39.947
If the heroes win here,

20:40.072 --> 20:45.077
then nothing will change!

20:45.786 --> 20:47.037
It's the call to action--

20:47.121 --> 20:48.831
From that night!

20:48.914 --> 20:53.377
Just w-walking... out in the daylight...

20:53.836 --> 20:58.340
I was sprayed with insecticide!

20:58.758 --> 21:03.512
If they get you, you can get them back!

21:04.430 --> 21:08.392
Comrades! Raise your voices!

21:08.768 --> 21:11.145
Follow me!

21:16.233 --> 21:18.402
He's gotten even stronger?!

21:19.153 --> 21:21.989
That punch was strong
enough to crush concrete!

21:28.913 --> 21:30.664
They're gaining momentum!

21:31.165 --> 21:32.666
There's no end to them!

21:32.958 --> 21:34.502
We can't wait any longer!

21:35.002 --> 21:36.378
They're pushing us back!

21:37.671 --> 21:40.382
W-We can't last much longer...

23:25.904 --> 23:27.031
PREVIEW

23:27.114 --> 23:28.240
HERE'S THE PREVIEW.

23:28.908 --> 23:33.454
Spinner stormed Central Hospital
to get Kurogiri back.

23:34.246 --> 23:37.625
Present Mic is there to
stop him and fight back.

23:38.626 --> 23:41.670
He can't let Kurogiri wake up.

23:41.754 --> 23:44.632
Even if they used to be best friends.

23:45.591 --> 23:47.968
Next time, "Butterfly Effect."

23:48.636 --> 23:51.847
The world can change through
the power of one person.

23:52.473 --> 23:53.932
NEXT TIME: BUTTERFLY EFFECT
- GO BEYOND!

23:54.058 --> 23:55.476
NEXT TIME: BUTTERFLY EFFECT
- PLUS ULTRA!
